# Enforced merge-authority ownership
#
# Keep this file deliberately narrow. `Protect main` requires Code Owner
# approval only when one of these control-plane paths changes; ordinary
# architecture/runtime PRs therefore remain approval-count 0.
#
# GitHub resolves CODEOWNERS from the PR base branch, so a pull request cannot
# replace this ownership mapping in the same change to authorize itself.

/.github/CODEOWNERS @blakinio
/.github/workflows/ @blakinio
/.github/repository-policy.json @blakinio
/tools/repository/ @blakinio
